WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.084 --> 01:44.104
=Episode 20=

01:53.630 --> 01:54.190
Thanks.

01:55.951 --> 01:57.190
My mom sent this.

01:59.871 --> 02:00.791
How is she doing?

02:01.830 --> 02:02.591
She's doing well.

02:03.231 --> 02:05.270
She's at a seaside
convalescent center in Sweden.

02:05.990 --> 02:07.511
My father is there with her.

02:08.070 --> 02:09.711
She probably won't be back anytime soon.

02:10.630 --> 02:11.391
Really?

02:12.551 --> 02:13.790
I never expected that

02:14.230 --> 02:16.630
after the divorce,
they actually got along better.

02:19.670 --> 02:20.350
Yeah.

02:22.591 --> 02:24.470
Mom often goes to the seaside market.

02:25.230 --> 02:26.871
She sends me these little trinkets.

02:29.670 --> 02:30.350
The seaside?

02:32.190 --> 02:34.031
It seems she's learned to move on.

02:37.630 --> 02:38.591
Perhaps.

02:40.031 --> 02:41.391
She was very ill then,

02:41.910 --> 02:43.950
with postpartum depression
and hormone imbalances.

02:45.991 --> 02:47.630
When I got these things,

02:47.871 --> 02:50.350
other than feeling sorry,
I mostly felt guilty.

02:51.630 --> 02:53.151
I regret not telling her sooner

02:53.271 --> 02:54.271
that I never blamed her.

03:01.271 --> 03:03.230
Now she's started to let go.

03:04.391 --> 03:04.991
What about you?

03:06.551 --> 03:07.111
Me?

03:10.630 --> 03:11.470
I...

03:14.151 --> 03:15.271
I want to live more freely.

03:16.711 --> 03:17.950
To experience everything

03:17.991 --> 03:19.048
I have never tried before.

03:21.630 --> 03:22.991
Anything specific in mind?

03:25.470 --> 03:26.311
Not yet.

03:31.350 --> 03:35.991
I-I've got something
you definitely can't do.

03:41.470 --> 03:42.670
For ice skating,

03:43.190 --> 03:44.470
I practiced a lot as a kid.

03:44.470 --> 03:45.391
It's quite hard.

03:46.190 --> 03:48.151
But practice makes perfect.

03:48.350 --> 03:49.551
Since it's your first time,

03:49.630 --> 03:50.910
it's totally normal

03:50.910 --> 03:51.991
if you don't skate well.

03:52.510 --> 03:54.151
It does have a learning curve.

03:54.470 --> 03:55.790
I haven't skated for long either

03:55.790 --> 03:57.070
and need some time to adapt to.

03:57.470 --> 03:59.551
How about this? I'll guide you later.

03:59.551 --> 04:00.470
Hold onto me first.

04:00.831 --> 04:02.551
We'll do a slow lap.

04:03.470 --> 04:05.350
Once you get used to it,

04:05.350 --> 04:07.111
you can follow me on your own.

04:07.272 --> 04:07.831
Okay.

04:07.831 --> 04:08.630
- Okay?
- Okay.

04:09.031 --> 04:10.790
- I get up first and help you then.
- Okay.

04:14.630 --> 04:15.151
Are you okay?

04:15.230 --> 04:16.670
- I'm fine.
- Get up.

04:24.031 --> 04:24.831
Be careful.

04:25.110 --> 04:25.910
Here, hold this.

04:26.751 --> 04:27.271
Are you okay?

04:27.271 --> 04:27.790
Wait.

04:28.350 --> 04:31.591
I really can skate.
It's just been too long.

04:31.591 --> 04:33.350
I-I need to readjust too, right?

04:34.711 --> 04:35.990
Well...

04:36.470 --> 04:38.031
What's fun about this?

04:38.470 --> 04:40.031
Isn't this the hottest

04:40.191 --> 04:41.670
date idea of the Millennium?

04:41.670 --> 04:43.310
We should experience it anyway.

04:47.751 --> 04:49.831
How about you hold onto me?

04:57.751 --> 04:58.751
Sure.

04:59.430 --> 04:59.951
Come on.

05:01.391 --> 05:02.110
Take it slow.

05:02.110 --> 05:03.110
It's okay. Just relax.

05:03.110 --> 05:03.990
Can you really skate?

05:03.990 --> 05:04.670
I can.

05:05.071 --> 05:06.151
Let go now.

05:06.151 --> 05:07.110
No! I'm not letting go.

05:07.110 --> 05:09.470
You'll make me fall, huh?

05:09.470 --> 05:10.120
Okay.

05:10.910 --> 05:12.470
Slowly. Relax.

05:13.711 --> 05:14.344
Relax.

05:16.031 --> 05:16.591
Relax.

05:19.391 --> 05:20.110
Not bad.

05:23.870 --> 05:25.831
You can skate! You lied to me?

05:26.790 --> 05:28.071
I just observed for a bit.

05:28.230 --> 05:29.790
It didn't seem that hard.

05:31.271 --> 05:33.550
It's different.
They're doing single skating.

05:33.550 --> 05:35.110
Ours is pairs skating,

05:35.110 --> 05:36.391
with higher difficulty level.

05:37.110 --> 05:39.031
The key is coordination.

05:39.591 --> 05:42.110
I was just trying to cooperate with you.

05:42.271 --> 05:42.910
Got it.

05:43.591 --> 05:45.031
So now you must

05:45.031 --> 05:46.391
hold onto me tightly.

05:46.910 --> 05:48.191
Don't let me fall, okay?

05:48.191 --> 05:48.776
Okay.

05:48.870 --> 05:49.448
Okay.

05:56.430 --> 05:57.000
Come on.

06:06.310 --> 06:06.910
Thanks.

06:08.711 --> 06:09.711
Be careful.

06:12.951 --> 06:15.230
You are pretty good at skating.

06:17.350 --> 06:18.350
Wait.

06:19.711 --> 06:20.271
How about

06:20.591 --> 06:21.230
trying again?

06:22.271 --> 06:22.790
Come on.

06:23.071 --> 06:24.430
Hold onto me. Come on.

06:26.470 --> 06:27.751
You can skate backwards now.

06:27.751 --> 06:28.296
Come on.

07:04.550 --> 07:05.192
Hello?

07:05.350 --> 07:05.951
Mr. Gao,

07:05.990 --> 07:08.230
one of the two rooms
booked for you and Miss Lin

07:08.230 --> 07:09.550
suddenly had a water leak.

07:09.550 --> 07:10.230
It's unavailable.

07:10.631 --> 07:11.831
Now only one room remains.

07:12.110 --> 07:13.470
I've checked a few nearby hotels.

07:13.751 --> 07:15.151
Should I rebook for you?

07:20.230 --> 07:21.110
Two rooms?

07:27.430 --> 07:28.670
No need.

08:00.296 --> 08:03.279
♪Entwined worries linger♪

08:04.488 --> 08:07.259
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

08:09.160 --> 08:15.073
♪Now I see what we missed♪

08:16.870 --> 08:19.930
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

08:21.096 --> 08:24.548
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

08:25.544 --> 08:31.070
♪Until the world's end♪

08:33.480 --> 08:37.276
♪If I could♪

08:37.864 --> 08:40.680
♪Keep loving you♪

08:41.704 --> 08:44.104
♪Hearing two hearts♪

08:44.104 --> 08:49.020
♪Beating together♪

08:49.992 --> 08:53.856
♪If I could♪

08:53.856 --> 08:57.096
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

08:58.152 --> 09:05.477
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

09:46.376 --> 09:48.424
(Newsstand)

09:53.031 --> 09:54.511
Off work now. It's your turn to rest.

09:56.070 --> 09:57.751
Here, I've changed the water for you.

09:58.430 --> 09:58.991
Thanks, Li.

09:59.190 --> 09:59.871
No problem.

10:04.511 --> 10:05.631
Can I change the channel?

10:05.950 --> 10:06.790
Go ahead.

10:10.696 --> 10:11.871
(Voice of Dreams: Grand Finals)

10:11.871 --> 10:14.871
(The competition among our
Voice of Dreams' top three finalists)

10:14.871 --> 10:16.511
(is truly intense!)

10:16.790 --> 10:18.790
Next up is a contestant

10:18.790 --> 10:20.710
who has captured everyone's attention,

10:20.790 --> 10:22.231
contestant Zhu Mengmeng!

10:22.231 --> 10:23.190
(Let's welcome her!)

10:25.190 --> 10:26.590
(Voice of Dreams: Grand Finals)
(It seems contestant Zhu Mengmeng)

10:26.590 --> 10:28.271
(wants to keep us in suspense,)

10:28.351 --> 10:29.670
(preferring to sing first)

10:29.670 --> 10:31.190
(before introducing herself.)

10:31.351 --> 10:32.351
Well then,

10:32.351 --> 10:34.190
everyone who isn't familiar

10:34.190 --> 10:35.031
with her yet,

10:35.031 --> 10:37.031
you better pay close attention!

10:37.710 --> 10:39.830
Hu, you like watching this?

10:40.670 --> 10:41.231
Yes.

10:43.720 --> 10:45.000
(Voice of Dreams: Grand Finals)

10:45.320 --> 10:48.776
♪Why won't you look at me♪

10:49.160 --> 10:52.104
♪Why won't you say a word♪

10:52.808 --> 10:58.504
♪Why can't you see what's on my mind♪

10:59.912 --> 11:03.048
♪I don't wanna hide in the corner♪

11:03.752 --> 11:06.952
♪Or do a monologue♪

11:07.336 --> 11:11.336
♪I don't wanna watch you from afar♪

11:12.456 --> 11:15.656
♪Like a fool♪

11:17.416 --> 11:19.336
♪I wanna be by your side♪

11:19.336 --> 11:21.096
♪To lean on your shoulder♪

11:21.096 --> 11:23.688
♪To hold the summer breeze♪

11:23.688 --> 11:24.840
♪And take it all in♪

11:24.840 --> 11:26.632
♪The sunset is so tender♪

11:26.632 --> 11:30.280
♪Melting every afternoon I miss you♪

11:30.280 --> 11:32.200
♪I wanna take a walk with you♪

11:32.200 --> 11:34.088
♪I wanna hold your hand♪

11:34.088 --> 11:36.776
♪Waiting until one night♪

11:36.776 --> 11:37.864
♪Beneath a sky of stars♪

11:37.864 --> 11:39.304
♪I'll tell you loud and clear♪

11:39.304 --> 11:42.984
♪I've liked you for so long♪

11:46.231 --> 11:47.710
(Contestant Zhu Mengmeng's singing)

11:47.710 --> 11:49.351
(is truly captivating.)

11:49.590 --> 11:51.310
(If I recall correctly,)

11:51.310 --> 11:54.070
this song is about unrequited love,

11:54.310 --> 11:54.910
right?

11:55.590 --> 11:57.511
It seems our contestant Zhu Mengmeng

11:57.511 --> 11:59.670
is still immersed
in the beautiful melody

11:59.670 --> 12:01.151
and hasn't snapped back yet.

12:01.430 --> 12:02.391
But that's alright.

12:02.391 --> 12:04.670
You can start introducing yourself now.

12:04.670 --> 12:07.471
We also have the "call your loved ones
for votes" part.

12:12.871 --> 12:13.830
Actually,

12:14.511 --> 12:16.670
the competition result

12:17.550 --> 12:18.710
isn't that important to me.

12:19.550 --> 12:21.111
Being able to stand here

12:21.231 --> 12:22.790
is already incredibly fortunate.

12:24.231 --> 12:25.111
Today,

12:27.070 --> 12:28.631
I want to thank someone.

12:31.111 --> 12:33.550
Without his encouragement and support,

12:34.430 --> 12:36.430
I probably wouldn't
have the courage to be here.

12:37.790 --> 12:38.790
(Silly Goose,)

12:40.351 --> 12:41.631
(I don't know why.)

12:41.871 --> 12:43.310
- Be careful next time.
- Got it.

12:43.550 --> 12:45.910
(You kept pushing me away before,)

12:46.550 --> 12:49.590
(but today, I really want to tell you)

12:50.471 --> 12:51.670
(that I like you.)

13:15.351 --> 13:16.391
Mengmeng, I like you.

13:17.670 --> 13:19.590
I've liked you

13:20.190 --> 13:21.271
since a very long time ago.

13:25.590 --> 13:26.271
It's just

13:27.590 --> 13:29.351
I never had the courage to tell you.

13:30.190 --> 13:32.231
I've hidden my feelings all these years,

13:33.991 --> 13:35.550
just because I felt

13:36.910 --> 13:38.351
I wasn't good enough for you.

13:39.190 --> 13:40.871
You were born to stand in the spotlight,

13:41.710 --> 13:42.631
while I

13:43.190 --> 13:44.950
only deserve to be dust beside you.

13:45.790 --> 13:47.111
So I selfishly hid

13:47.111 --> 13:48.190
my own emotions,

13:49.190 --> 13:50.430
pushing you away constantly.

13:52.070 --> 13:53.751
But every time I pushed you away,

13:54.950 --> 13:56.111
I also felt terrible.

13:59.391 --> 14:00.950
So Mengmeng, I want to apologize.

14:03.550 --> 14:04.550
Because I am the one

14:04.550 --> 14:05.871
who lacks courage in love.

14:06.871 --> 14:07.496
Can...

14:10.511 --> 14:11.950
Can you give me another chance?

14:18.590 --> 14:20.910
The nation-wide audience heard that.

14:22.271 --> 14:22.950
The TV...

14:25.790 --> 14:27.670
(Is this your promise to me?)

14:43.550 --> 14:44.104
Yes,

14:45.231 --> 14:46.190
this is my promise.

14:47.710 --> 14:48.790
(This is truly)

14:48.790 --> 14:51.631
(the most thrilling
loved ones call part tonight.)

15:16.430 --> 15:17.550
Wish you winning,

15:17.550 --> 15:18.670
and achieving your dream.

15:26.511 --> 15:27.151
Thank you.

15:39.910 --> 15:42.231
- Cheers!
- Congrats to Mengmeng for winning!

15:43.590 --> 15:44.310
Thank you.

15:44.590 --> 15:46.111
I owe it to you all.

15:46.111 --> 15:46.790
Without you,

15:46.790 --> 15:48.550
I never would've
had the courage to compete.

15:48.871 --> 15:50.031
Let alone win an award.

15:50.511 --> 15:51.710
You've always had the talent.

15:54.271 --> 15:54.871
Congrats.

15:54.871 --> 15:57.430
And congratulations to you two
for finally being in love.

15:57.871 --> 15:58.790
Thank you.

16:01.310 --> 16:03.670
Today's the last day of the Millennium.

16:03.871 --> 16:05.590
Let's go celebrate at the square!

16:05.590 --> 16:06.471
Let's head out now.

16:06.471 --> 16:08.151
No! You're a celebrity now.

16:08.151 --> 16:09.351
So many people recognize you.

16:09.871 --> 16:11.511
It's not even midnight yet.

16:11.511 --> 16:13.231
People are piling in.
How can we celebrate?

16:15.310 --> 16:16.351
You've got a point.

16:18.190 --> 16:20.751
I wonder what life will be like

16:20.751 --> 16:22.111
after the Millennium.

16:22.590 --> 16:23.751
Will every household

16:23.751 --> 16:25.351
have flying cars?

16:26.391 --> 16:28.151
Who knows what the future holds?

16:30.351 --> 16:31.070
But

16:31.391 --> 16:33.271
Huan'er would know best
about the future,

16:33.790 --> 16:34.430
right?

16:35.790 --> 16:36.710
So Huan'er, tell us.

16:41.710 --> 16:42.670
In the future,

16:44.430 --> 16:46.111
things do turn out pretty well.

16:47.231 --> 16:49.111
No flying cars yet,

16:50.471 --> 16:52.271
but some things and people

16:52.271 --> 16:53.670
are truly irreplaceable.

16:56.351 --> 16:57.111
Like you guys.

16:59.590 --> 17:01.830
Then let's toast
to our irreplaceable bond!

17:01.830 --> 17:02.536
- Come on.
- Come on.

17:02.536 --> 17:03.624
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

17:03.670 --> 17:04.271
Cheers!

17:10.870 --> 17:11.630
It's almost time.

17:12.390 --> 17:14.376
For such a moment,
how about taking a group photo?

17:15.711 --> 17:16.271
Let's go.

17:16.271 --> 17:16.840
Let's go.

17:30.191 --> 17:31.110
Wait a second.

17:35.671 --> 17:36.790
You've got sparklers?

17:36.790 --> 17:37.911
When did you get these?

17:38.350 --> 17:39.110
Huan'er, come.

17:40.471 --> 17:42.550
How do I set the timer on this camera?

17:43.471 --> 17:44.168
Here.

17:46.711 --> 17:47.630
Right here.

17:50.830 --> 17:51.471
No flash.

17:51.471 --> 17:52.471
Huan'er, let me fix it.

17:52.471 --> 17:53.231
Okay, I got it.

17:53.231 --> 17:53.790
Let me do it.

18:08.711 --> 18:09.511
Oh my!

18:12.150 --> 18:12.671
Huan'er,

18:14.671 --> 18:15.751
will you marry me?

18:17.590 --> 18:19.031
Spend the turn of the millennium

18:19.870 --> 18:21.231
and every day after with me.

18:22.344 --> 18:25.896
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

18:26.471 --> 18:27.070
Everyone,

18:27.231 --> 18:28.350
it's almost midnight!

18:28.991 --> 18:29.790
Come here!

18:30.031 --> 18:30.991
Come on!

18:30.991 --> 18:34.870
Ten, nine, eight,

18:35.271 --> 18:38.951
seven, six, five,

18:39.150 --> 18:42.790
four, three, two,

18:43.231 --> 18:44.511
one!

18:45.271 --> 18:47.550
Happy New Year!

18:49.800 --> 18:52.136
Happy New Year!

18:57.911 --> 18:58.590
Huan'er!

19:12.350 --> 19:13.751
Happy New Year!

19:15.070 --> 19:15.991
Call the police!

19:17.790 --> 19:18.630
Get an ambulance!

19:19.816 --> 19:20.872
Someone got hit!

19:34.471 --> 19:36.231
This world isn't real!

19:37.031 --> 19:38.911
You're all characters in a book!

19:41.231 --> 19:42.350
Call the police now!

19:43.048 --> 19:43.816
Is he okay?

19:50.191 --> 19:51.991
This world isn't real!

19:52.200 --> 19:53.640
What is she saying?

19:53.951 --> 19:55.711
You're all characters in a book!

19:55.711 --> 19:56.870
What's wrong with her?

19:57.310 --> 20:01.150
I traveled here from 2025!

20:02.070 --> 20:03.191
Help him first.

20:03.471 --> 20:04.511
Just help him.

20:04.511 --> 20:06.231
Yeah. What set her off like this?

20:08.150 --> 20:10.471
Player revealed
the game's truth to others.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.880
Punishment mechanism triggered.

20:12.110 --> 20:13.711
You've exhausted all chances.

20:13.830 --> 20:16.830
Maximum penalty will now apply.

20:36.390 --> 20:36.951
Mengmeng.

20:36.951 --> 20:37.711
- How is it?
- Look.

20:41.830 --> 20:42.550
Beautiful.

20:43.751 --> 20:44.271
Huan'er?

20:46.550 --> 20:47.400
Where's Gao Haiming?

20:48.191 --> 20:49.790
Why are you asking about Gao Haiming?

20:50.711 --> 20:51.912
Tiehan, where is Gao Haiming?

20:53.271 --> 20:54.431
How do you know Gao Haiming?

21:54.911 --> 21:56.830
Lin Huan'er violated game rules.

21:57.031 --> 21:58.550
All five chances were depleted.

21:59.031 --> 22:01.150
You now face
the system's ultimate penalty.

22:01.390 --> 22:02.431
System will erase

22:02.431 --> 22:04.031
all memories between you
and Gao Haiming.

22:04.310 --> 22:06.231
Gao Haiming will forget you.

22:17.630 --> 22:18.271
Huan'er,

22:18.630 --> 22:19.310
what's wrong?

22:21.191 --> 22:22.511
It's nothing, Mengmeng. I...

22:23.911 --> 22:24.911
I'm not feeling well.

22:24.911 --> 22:25.671
You guys have fun.

22:33.832 --> 22:36.815
♪Entwined worries linger♪

22:38.024 --> 22:40.795
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

22:42.696 --> 22:48.609
♪Now I see what we missed♪

22:50.406 --> 22:53.466
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

22:56.511 --> 22:57.590
Huan'er, why are you here?

22:57.830 --> 22:59.550
Didn't you go celebrate with friends?

23:01.671 --> 23:04.231
It ended, so I came back.

23:05.830 --> 23:07.471
What's wrong? Didn't you have fun?

23:09.431 --> 23:10.790
Why are you back so late?

23:11.350 --> 23:12.904
I just got back from Ningning's place.

23:13.031 --> 23:13.991
We stayed out late.

23:15.951 --> 23:17.031
Huan'er, what's wrong?

23:17.550 --> 23:20.191
Did you fight with your boyfriend
during the celebration?

23:22.310 --> 23:22.991
Le'er,

23:24.431 --> 23:25.751
you remember Gao Haiming, right?

23:27.310 --> 23:28.711
I actually found out?

23:28.711 --> 23:30.511
So you really have a new boyfriend!

23:30.671 --> 23:32.471
When do I get to meet

23:32.471 --> 23:33.110
Gao Haiming?

23:36.310 --> 23:37.671
You've met Gao Haiming.

23:38.271 --> 23:39.070
Did you forget?

23:40.431 --> 23:41.231
No, I haven't.

23:44.072 --> 23:47.070
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

23:47.070 --> 23:48.390
I was just teasing you.

23:48.872 --> 23:54.472
♪Now I see what we missed♪

23:54.991 --> 23:55.511
Huan'er,

23:55.711 --> 23:56.711
if you're unhappy,

23:56.711 --> 23:57.991
you have to tell me.

24:01.911 --> 24:02.550
Have one.

24:02.870 --> 24:04.390
Eat something sweet. Cheer up.

24:05.256 --> 24:10.550
♪Until the world's end♪

24:10.550 --> 24:11.550
Thank you.

24:13.511 --> 24:14.271
Be good.

24:14.511 --> 24:15.951
Everything will be okay.

24:17.070 --> 24:17.830
I hope so.

24:18.870 --> 24:20.110
I need some time alone.

24:20.390 --> 24:21.310
You head back first.

24:22.191 --> 24:22.856
Okay.

24:23.511 --> 24:25.031
Make sure you go home early too.

24:25.751 --> 24:26.550
Don't worry.

24:29.608 --> 24:32.840
♪If I could♪

24:34.150 --> 24:35.711
Why did you stop working?

24:36.951 --> 24:38.431
What gives you the right to stop?

24:39.830 --> 24:41.031
This is all your fault!

24:42.671 --> 24:43.590
All because of you!

24:44.951 --> 24:46.431
How dare you ignore me?

24:59.784 --> 25:01.640
(Letao Tower)

25:17.711 --> 25:18.590
Happy New Year!

25:19.310 --> 25:20.671
Did you all have fun?

25:23.110 --> 25:23.870
Your friend?

25:24.431 --> 25:25.070
No.

25:26.191 --> 25:27.231
Not my friend either.

25:28.590 --> 25:29.431
I don't know her.

25:35.711 --> 25:36.830
Where are my things here?

25:39.671 --> 25:41.711
Lin Huan'er, what are you doing here?

25:42.150 --> 25:44.431
My stuff was cleared away. I...

25:45.830 --> 25:47.176
You drank too much on the night?

25:47.350 --> 25:48.550
You work downstairs.

25:49.191 --> 25:50.630
Since when do I work downstairs?

25:50.630 --> 25:52.070
Okay, get back to work now.

25:53.911 --> 25:55.590
I think I have seen her downstairs.

25:57.271 --> 25:58.511
So I never actually

25:58.511 --> 25:59.630
worked here?

26:00.271 --> 26:01.070
Yeah.

26:04.231 --> 26:04.872
Mr. Gao.

26:05.231 --> 26:06.390
- Mr. Gao.
- Morning, Mr. Gao.

26:16.830 --> 26:17.790
(I see.)

26:18.110 --> 26:19.830
(The system is punishing me.)

26:20.390 --> 26:22.590
(It erased all our memories together.)

26:24.231 --> 26:25.070
(Gao Haiming,)

26:26.310 --> 26:27.671
(if I stay,)

26:29.350 --> 26:30.671
(will you remember me?)

26:34.590 --> 26:35.310
Mr. Luo.

26:36.751 --> 26:38.431
Look. This seat is empty.

26:38.431 --> 26:39.830
Can I move here to work?

26:40.350 --> 26:42.231
Go apply
with the admin department yourself.

26:47.951 --> 26:48.630
(Gao Haiming,)

26:49.671 --> 26:51.110
(even if memories don't return,)

26:51.751 --> 26:53.511
(I'll make you
fall in love with me again.)

27:05.310 --> 27:05.870
Hello?

27:07.350 --> 27:08.951
What? Are you injured?

27:09.630 --> 27:10.630
I'm coming right away.

27:12.431 --> 27:15.150
Didn't you promise me
you wouldn't get hurt again?

27:15.431 --> 27:16.870
I was scared to death just now!

27:16.870 --> 27:18.870
I almost drove the car into the river!

27:19.951 --> 27:21.271
No need to make a fuss.

27:21.671 --> 27:22.870
Look, I'm fine.

27:22.870 --> 27:23.511
I don't care!

27:24.350 --> 27:25.231
Hu Tiehan,

27:25.590 --> 27:27.350
your body belongs to me now!

27:27.431 --> 27:28.991
I won't let you get hurt again!

27:29.032 --> 27:30.310
(Police)

27:30.310 --> 27:32.630
Mengmeng, you should be proud of Tiehan.

27:32.870 --> 27:33.511
Do you know

27:33.511 --> 27:34.511
he helped us

27:34.511 --> 27:35.711
solve a major case?

27:36.070 --> 27:36.830
Tiehan

27:36.830 --> 27:38.231
was born to be the criminal police.

27:38.870 --> 27:40.271
I just won't allow him to get hurt!

27:42.630 --> 27:43.471
Does it still hurt?

27:44.630 --> 27:45.310
No.

27:45.951 --> 27:47.110
Mengmeng, I promise you.

27:47.751 --> 27:48.350
From now on...

27:48.550 --> 27:49.951
Hey, watch it. I'm here.

27:55.390 --> 27:56.231
I promise you.

27:57.150 --> 27:58.671
I won't let myself get hurt anymore.

27:59.590 --> 28:00.310
Really?

28:01.471 --> 28:02.110
Yes.

28:02.671 --> 28:04.271
You really can't get hurt again.

28:05.471 --> 28:06.870
I won't get hurt ever again.

28:10.310 --> 28:11.431
- So you...
- Don't worry.

28:13.271 --> 28:14.671
I'm just doing them a small favor.

28:15.590 --> 28:18.911
I won't go back. I mean it.

28:19.951 --> 28:21.070
You know how my mom is.

28:21.070 --> 28:22.630
She'd never let me go back.

28:23.550 --> 28:24.191
Besides,

28:24.511 --> 28:26.431
the criminal police squad
isn't someplace

28:26.431 --> 28:27.431
I can just waltz into.

28:29.150 --> 28:30.711
Am I being too selfish?

28:32.310 --> 28:35.231
No. Why would you say that?

28:35.830 --> 28:38.550
I didn't dare chase my dreams before.

28:38.870 --> 28:41.511
You were the one
who kept encouraging and helping me.

28:43.711 --> 28:45.390
Now our positions have switched.

28:45.471 --> 28:46.120
I...

28:46.390 --> 28:47.431
That's not how it is.

28:48.711 --> 28:50.310
I know you mean well for me.

28:53.310 --> 28:54.991
But are you truly happy?

28:56.671 --> 28:57.191
Yes.

28:58.231 --> 29:00.191
As long as you're happy, I'm happy.

29:07.911 --> 29:08.830
I've decided.

29:10.231 --> 29:12.830
From now on, I'll support

29:12.830 --> 29:14.471
all your dreams and decisions.

29:14.991 --> 29:16.271
But you have to promise me.

29:18.070 --> 29:19.431
Take good care of yourself.

29:22.751 --> 29:25.870
Okay, I promise
to take good care of myself.

29:53.350 --> 29:53.951
Mr. Gao.

29:55.431 --> 29:56.191
Why are you here?

29:56.550 --> 29:57.711
Giving Mr. Gao documents.

29:58.070 --> 29:59.991
Documents should go
to department managers.

29:59.991 --> 30:01.191
Don't take it all to Mr. Gao.

30:02.671 --> 30:03.304
So...

30:12.390 --> 30:13.630
You finished it so fast?

30:14.911 --> 30:16.310
I haven't been too busy lately.

30:16.550 --> 30:17.951
Okay, I'll put it away for now.

30:21.870 --> 30:22.431
Thank you.

30:36.991 --> 30:37.590
Mr. Gao.

30:40.790 --> 30:41.751
What brings you here?

30:43.231 --> 30:44.790
I came to buy a model aircraft.

30:46.911 --> 30:47.951
You like these too?

30:50.431 --> 30:51.830
A friend of mine likes them.

30:52.671 --> 30:53.671
At first,

30:54.191 --> 30:56.150
I researched fighter jets

30:56.870 --> 30:58.070
just to find common topics.

30:59.310 --> 31:00.471
But gradually,

31:00.870 --> 31:02.431
I realized I actually enjoyed them too.

31:04.310 --> 31:06.390
But that friend lost his memory.

31:07.751 --> 31:08.911
He doesn't remember me now.

31:10.951 --> 31:12.991
So I want to gift him a model fighter,

31:13.951 --> 31:16.310
hoping it'll help him remember me.

31:20.150 --> 31:20.790
Mr. Gao,

31:22.150 --> 31:23.191
I have a request.

31:23.711 --> 31:24.296
What is it?

31:30.951 --> 31:32.271
Could you please

31:32.550 --> 31:34.671
help me assemble
this Wild Weasel fighter?

31:36.590 --> 31:37.431
Why me?

31:42.830 --> 31:44.110
Because I trust you the most.

31:45.550 --> 31:47.191
Maybe the model you assemble

31:48.431 --> 31:49.711
will trigger his memory of me.

31:57.110 --> 31:57.671
Alright.

31:58.191 --> 31:59.110
I'll take this job.

32:03.231 --> 32:04.550
They're quite unhappy over there.

32:05.110 --> 32:05.991
We need to check it.

32:06.070 --> 32:07.150
Okay, I'll note it down.

32:07.790 --> 32:08.471
Go coordinate.

32:08.471 --> 32:09.031
Okay.

32:15.191 --> 32:16.310
Did something happen today?

32:17.830 --> 32:18.751
Someone leaked

32:18.991 --> 32:20.511
that Letao's new sanitary pads

32:20.511 --> 32:21.590
have quality issues.

32:21.951 --> 32:23.471
Some experienced physical discomfort.

32:24.511 --> 32:25.191
See for yourself.

32:25.191 --> 32:26.110
That's impossible!

32:27.048 --> 32:27.911
(Her Series Sanitary Pads' Quality)
How could Quality Inspection

32:27.911 --> 32:29.390
(in Question: Who Protects Consumers)
make such a big mistake?

32:29.550 --> 32:31.191
If this situation continues,

32:31.550 --> 32:33.751
Mr. Gao might face serious trouble.

32:34.191 --> 32:35.110
I heard the board

32:35.191 --> 32:36.671
summoned Mr. Gao immediately.

32:37.110 --> 32:38.191
The product he oversaw

32:38.191 --> 32:39.350
has quality defects.

32:39.711 --> 32:42.070
He might even get dismissed.

32:43.550 --> 32:44.550
Surely not that bad?

32:45.031 --> 32:45.544
He...

32:46.471 --> 32:47.630
Forget what I said.

32:58.433 --> 33:01.416
♪Entwined worries linger♪

33:02.625 --> 33:05.396
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

33:07.297 --> 33:13.210
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

33:15.007 --> 33:18.067
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

33:19.233 --> 33:22.685
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

33:23.681 --> 33:29.207
♪Until the world's end♪

33:31.617 --> 33:35.413
♪If I could♪

33:36.001 --> 33:38.817
♪Keep loving you♪

33:39.841 --> 33:42.241
♪Hearing two hearts♪

33:42.241 --> 33:47.157
♪Beating together♪

33:48.129 --> 33:51.993
♪If I could♪

33:51.993 --> 33:55.233
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

33:56.289 --> 34:03.614
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

34:04.673 --> 34:07.617
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:08.865 --> 34:11.617
